  "words": [
    {
      "text": "Your silhouette against the blue\n",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 16.93
    },
    {
      "text": "A thousand miles between us two\n",
      "start": 17.84,
      "end": 20.38
    },
    {
      "text": "I hear your voice inside the breeze\n",
      "start": 21.24,
      "end": 24.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Like summer dancing through the trees\n",
      "start": 24.64,
      "end": 27.38
    },
    {
      "text": "And I don't know where we're going\n",
      "start": 28.48,
      "end": 31.49
    },
    {
      "text": "I just know we can't stay\n",
      "start": 31.78,
      "end": 35.2
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a thousand roads before us\n",
      "start": 35.36,
      "end": 38.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And the ocean in our way\n",
      "start": 38.72,
      "end": 41.31
    },
    {
      "text": "So let the tradewinds carry me\n",
      "start": 42.02,
      "end": 44.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Across the endless sea\n",
      "start": 45.92,
      "end": 48.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Where the stars fall down like memories\n",
      "start": 48.24,
      "end": 51.44
    },
    {
      "text": "And everything is free\n",
      "start": 52.68,
      "end": 55.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, we were young, we were wild\n",
      "start": 55.28,
      "end": 58.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Like the waves beneath the sky\n",
      "start": 59.04,
      "end": 61.93
    },
    {
      "text": "If I ever lose my way\n",
      "start": 62.24,
      "end": 65.36
    },
    {
